</div>
<div class="trust-progress-details" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 1rem;">
<span id="progress-trust-value" style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 900; color: #fbbf24;">0.0</span>
<svg class="trust-trend-line" fill="none" style="width: 80px; height: 35px;" viewbox="0 0 64 28" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<polyline fill="none" points="2,24 14,18 24,14 34,16 46,8 62,3" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2"></polyline>
</svg>
</div>
<div data-i18n="html_trust_builds_slowly_through_discipline_a" style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
                        Trust builds slowly through discipline and consistency. Penalty protection is active at higher streak levels.
                    </div>
</div>
<!-- Achievements System (Grid, Filters, Search) -->
<div class="card achievements-section" data-i18n="html_toggle_button_to_show_hide_achievements_" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
<div class="achievements-header">
